  m_text: '<b><i>ASTRONAUT</b></i>

    Yes. I have learned that the Great Evil,
    or The Boss, lives on an uninhabitable planet of unknown name. They must be inorganic,
    to be able to reside on such a planet. Hold on, I am beginning to see it through
    my window. Over.



